@startuml payment-casos-de-uso
left to right direction

title CDU004 - Gestionar pagos

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1168BD
    FontColor #1168BD
}
skinparam actor {
    BorderColor #398819
    FontColor #398819
}

actor "Cajero Receptor" as actor_payment_teller
actor "Administrador" as actor_payment_admin
actor "Transaction Service" as actor_payment_transaction
actor "Banco participante / contrato v1" as actor_payment_provider

rectangle "CDU004 - Gestionar pagos" as system_payment {
    usecase "CDU004.1:\nProcesar pago" as uc_payment_process
    usecase "CDU004.2:\nConsultar historial de pagos" as uc_payment_history
    usecase "CDU004.3:\nValidar operación de pago" as uc_payment_validate
    usecase "CDU004.4:\nSimular pago interno\n(sin proveedor HTTP)" as uc_payment_internal
    usecase "CDU004.5:\nEnviar al banco\n(HTTP v1 / X-Api-Key)" as uc_payment_external
    usecase "CDU004.6:\nReintentar procesamiento" as uc_payment_retry
    usecase "CDU004.7:\nRegistrar estado del pago" as uc_payment_record
}

actor_payment_teller -- uc_payment_history
actor_payment_admin -- uc_payment_history
actor_payment_transaction -- uc_payment_process
actor_payment_provider -- uc_payment_external

uc_payment_process .> uc_payment_validate : <<include>>
uc_payment_process .> uc_payment_record : <<include>>
uc_payment_internal .> uc_payment_process : <<extend>>
uc_payment_external .> uc_payment_process : <<extend>>
uc_payment_retry .> uc_payment_process : <<extend>>

note right of uc_payment_process
    En la Saga de transferencias,
    Transaction Service publica payment.requested.v1.
    Payment responde payment.succeeded.v1 o payment.failed.v1.
end note

note bottom of uc_payment_history
    La lista de monitoreo es solo de personal.
    Un cliente consulta un pago concreto por su id y ve
    su historial dentro de la transferencia que lo originó:
    Payment Service no guarda referencia al cliente.
end note
legend bottom
  Implementación: Node.js 24 / NestJS / TypeScript.
  Mensajes internos: RabbitMQ / AMQP 0-9-1; correlationId y traceparent.
  Persistencia: PostgreSQL exclusivo por servicio. Entrada: Gateway HTTP / JWT / roles.
  Vistas complementarias de Fase III: diagrama 13 e índice de arquitectura.
endlegend
@enduml
